      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i need help figuring something out and it's honestly starting to freak me out a little bit. i think my body is starting to... sync up with things i see. \n\nit's like, i'll see a specific number, and then immediately my pulse will jump to that rhythm. like earlier today i saw 77 on a sign and my heart felt like it was doing this weird double-thump... exactly 77 beats per minute or something. then i was walking and i saw a clock hit 12, and for exactly 12 seconds, my breathing felt like it was being forced into this mechanical, rhythmic pattern that i couldn't break.\n\nit's like the numbers are \"setting\" my biological rhythm. can you look at these and see if there's a mathematical connection between the numbers i'm seeing and what's happening to my body? i feel like i'm losing control of my own physical functions to these sequences.",
